mapper.select:
SELECT OutAmt.코드 As code, OutAmt.날짜 as date, OutAmt.금액 as amt, OutAmt.비고 as cnte, OutAmt.계정코드1 as code1, OutAmt.계정코드2 as code2, OutAmt.계정코드3 as code3, OutAmt.코드분류 As codeGb, CoutConf1.관 As cdNm1, CoutConf2.항 As cdNm2, CoutConf3.목 As cdNm3, OutAmt.년도 As year, OutAmt.UER_YN As uerYn FROM 지출_temp OutAmt left outer join 지출관 CoutConf1 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf1.관코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf1.코드분류 left outer join 지출항 CoutConf2 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf2.관코드 and OutAmt.계정코드2 = CoutConf2.항코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf2.코드분류 left outer join 지출목 CoutConf3 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf3.관코드 and OutAmt.계정코드2 = CoutConf3.항코드 and OutAmt.계정코드3 = CoutConf3.목코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf3.코드분류 WHERE 1 = 1
AND OutAmt.UER_YN = #{uerYn}
AND OutAmt.코드분류 = #{codeGb}
AND OutAmt.년도 = #{year}
AND OutAmt.코드 = #{code}
AND OutAmt.코드 = (Select Max(코드) From 지출_temp)

SELECT OutAmt.코드 As code, OutAmt.날짜 as date, OutAmt.금액 as amt, OutAmt.비고 as cnte, OutAmt.계정코드1 as code1, OutAmt.계정코드2 as code2, OutAmt.계정코드3 as code3, OutAmt.코드분류 As codeGb, CoutConf1.관 As cdNm1, CoutConf2.항 As cdNm2, CoutConf3.목 As cdNm3, OutAmt.년도 As year, OutAmt.UER_YN As uerYn FROM 지출_temp OutAmt left outer join 지출관 CoutConf1 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf1.관코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf1.코드분류 left outer join 지출항 CoutConf2 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf2.관코드 and OutAmt.계정코드2 = CoutConf2.항코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf2.코드분류 left outer join 지출목 CoutConf3 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf3.관코드 and OutAmt.계정코드2 = CoutConf3.항코드 and OutAmt.계정코드3 = CoutConf3.목코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf3.코드분류 WHERE 1 = 1
AND OutAmt.UER_YN = #{uerYn}
AND OutAmt.코드분류 = #{codeGb}
AND OutAmt.년도 = #{year}
AND OutAmt.날짜 >= #{fmDate}
AND OutAmt.날짜 <= #{toDate}
order by OutAmt.날짜, OutAmt.코드 desc
